  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Season the chicken breast with salt, black pepper, and a pinch of sambal oelek.",
    "Dredge the chicken in almond flour, pressing gently to adhere.",
    "Add the chicken to the skillet and cook for 5 minutes on each side, or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, mix Asian chive buchu, coconut aminos, garlic, and ginger in a small bowl.",
    "Once the chicken is cooked, transfer it to a Korean brass bowl.",
    "Add the Asian chive buchu mixture on top of the chicken.",
    "Sprinkle shredded gruyère cheese over the top of the bowl.",
    "Microwave the bowl for 20-30 seconds, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and serve immediately."
  ],
